  destinations:
  - destinationName: Sandy Beach
    description: 'Golden sands stretch along the sparkling shoreline beneath the
      warm tropical sun.

      Gentle waves wash ashore while seashells and hidden
      treasures await curious explorers.

      Feel the refreshing ocean breeze
      as you journey along the peaceful coast.

      Every step brings a new seaside
      adventure waiting to be discovered.'
    background: {fileID: -8578183933221340778, guid: 01699a3a239f641fc9a1ee42ea3c60a4, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Coral Reef
    description: 'Dive beneath crystal-clear waters into a colorful underwater paradise.

      Brilliant
      coral gardens are home to playful fish and fascinating sea creatures.

      Hidden
      treasures sparkle among the vibrant reefs.

      Every puzzle reveals another
      breathtaking corner of the ocean.'
    background: {fileID: -506248469827834193, guid: 5e992c075f78b472f80eb8cdf2f82b60, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Blue Lagoon
    description: 'A peaceful lagoon glows with brilliant shades of turquoise and
      sapphire.

      Calm waters reflect the endless sky, creating a picture-perfect
      escape.

      Explore hidden coves and secret pathways around the shoreline.

      Nature''s
      beauty surrounds every moment of your adventure.'
    background: {fileID: 895686523750061401, guid: 32da66d85efc04a818275d884838c86d, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Pirate Cove
    description: 'A hidden cove once served as the secret refuge of legendary pirates.

      Old
      ships, forgotten maps, and mysterious caves hold stories of lost treasure.

      Search
      every corner to uncover long-buried riches.

      Adventure and mystery await
      every fearless explorer.'
    background: {fileID: 5825439195892849121, guid: 2fc302c1f3eae44c88a390dca3d4c09d, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Lighthouse
    description: 'A towering lighthouse watches over the endless sea with its guiding
      light.

      Climb winding staircases to admire breathtaking ocean views.

      Hidden
      paths around the rocky cliffs conceal exciting discoveries.

      Every beacon
      shines the way toward your next adventure.'
    background: {fileID: -8239933057047612337, guid: 6b04540313ec742acb2ea3e56f0e1a48, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Island Bay
    description: 'A secluded island paradise welcomes explorers with crystal-clear
      waters and lush greenery.

      Gentle waves and tropical breezes create the
      perfect place to unwind.

      Discover hidden beaches, ancient secrets, and
      sparkling treasures.

      Every journey across the bay feels like a dream
      come true.'
    background: {fileID: 506880638764355997, guid: f83c134f61d6b493a80e9786c0581efe, type: 3}
